@startuml
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Logout: two subscribers, no ordering guarantee
participant "Account.Container" as C
participant "Dispatcher / RootSaga" as D
participant "Auth Saga" as A
participant "Auth router adapter / UI" as R
participant "Auth Service" as S
participant "SampleApp Saga" as App
participant "Relux Store" as Store
C -> D : Auth.Effect.logout
D -> A : apply(logout)
A -> R : dispatch setAuth(.logoutFlow)
R -> D : LogoutFlow.Container task:\nEffect.runLogoutFlow
par Auth subscriber
 D -> A : apply(runLogoutFlow)
 A -> S : recreateLAContext()
 S --> A : returns
 A -> R : dispatch setAuth(.localAuth)
 A -> D : Action.logOutSucceed
else app subscriber
 D -> App : apply(runLogoutFlow)
 App -> Store : cleanup(exclusions: [AppRouter.self])
 Store --> App : returns
end
note over A,Store
Neither registration order nor serial actions order subscribers.
Store cleanup does not erase Notes Fetcher's dictionary.
Late-result rejection / session-safe provider reset is an exercise.
end note
@enduml
